 ('Chapter 1: Just Like Paradise', ['Prologue','Gone Fishing','Gear Up','Just A Scratch','Lab Fees','Unwanted Attention','Pipework','Hey Arnold!','Island Dreams','Feng Shui','Coming Home','Buck Me','Clean Up After Donnie','Down to Earth','Clear Skies','Day Release','Swamped',None,'Recalibration','Tourist Trap','Home Sweet Home','Discharge Time']),
